    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, wow! I'd love to meet your parents too! What do you think the best time for us to go would be?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T07:32:22.587028+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, the best time to go would probably be during the weekend, maybe on a Sunday or Saturday. What do you think about that?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T07:33:54.166162+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure, the best time to go for me would be during the weekend, maybe on a Sunday or Saturday. I'm looking forward to meeting your parents.",
