    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I see. You're planning on going for a Sunday or Saturday weekend then? That sounds great! I have plenty of time on my hands over the weekend, so it wouldn't be a problem for me.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T07:38:54.676547+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, wow! That sounds great! I can't wait to meet your parents!",
