    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thanks for the info, I really appreciate it! And yes, I'd be happy to meet your parents sometime too!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T07:54:14.136798+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, wow! That sounds great! I'm looking forward to meeting your parents!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T07:58:50.155674+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm really looking forward to it! What did you think of my parents? Do they do anything fun?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T08:29:17.021669+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure, it's always fun to meet new people. What do you think the best time for us to go would be?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T08:34:56.860578+00:00"
    },
    {
