    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What do you mean by fun or interesting to do? Like, what kind of things?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T10:04:14.183108+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What do you mean by fun or interesting to do? Like, what kind of things? What would be good for me?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T10:13:24.032129+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'd like to go to the Grand Canyon, it sounds amazing! But I was wondering if there were any other places you could recommend that are fun and interesting. Maybe we can do some of those together someday?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T10:23:36.998020+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'd be happy to recommend some other places to visit. If you're interested in visiting more than one place at once, you could try going to the San Diego Zoo or the USS Arizona Memorial and Museum. They offer a lot of interesting exhibits that we can explore together.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T10:26:17.167223+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Great! Can you recommend some fun places to visit together? Like, what kind of places are you interested in going?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T10:32:06.690617+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Sure, we can visit the San Diego Zoo! What would you like to do there? I know that they have great tours and a lot of wild animals. Would it be a good spot for us?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T10:38:52.611641+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I'd like to see the different animals that they have. What is their biggest animal?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T10:44:46.510599+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, that's really nice of you to want to see all the animals, Olivia. I don't have a lot of time, but I can definitely recommend the San Diego Zoo!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T11:00:57.742704+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks for recommending the San Diego Zoo! I really want to see all the different animals, so that sounds perfect. I'll definitely plan a visit soon.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-04T11:35:02.910574+00:00"
    }
